"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:25:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T09:40:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.beta.custom_build [b01ceac87], and 4.5.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (b01ceac87) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8228) - AMD FX(tm)-6300 Six-Core Processor (6 threads) - 15.98 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen zooming in or out in a GraphEdit, any GraphElement with a pivot offset that is not at (0, 0) will shift out of place.\n\nThe position is only correct when the editor's zoom is at 100%. I think its likely that the issue is caused by not recalculating `position` with pivot offsets included.\n\n\n<img width=\"119\" height=\"130\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/922fb6f6-343a-46ab-8b34-2fc97d9a1087\" />\n\n<img width=\"119\" height=\"130\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cbc9f46e-e357-40ee-87ee-c395818f6452\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a graph edit\n- Add two graph elements\n- Set the pivot offset of one graph element.\n- Adjust the zoom of the graph edit to values other than 1.0\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[graph-edit-incorrect-position.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28873368/graph-edit-incorrect-position.zip) < v4.7","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}